OBST repository licensing
===========================

This repository contains material under multiple licenses. The SPDX metadata
in each file, or its matching REUSE.toml annotation, is authoritative.

- Reference implementation, tooling and general project documentation:
  Mozilla Public License 2.0 (LICENSES/MPL-2.0.txt)
- Normative OBST format documentation and normative Extension contracts:
  Creative Commons Attribution-NoDerivatives 4.0 International
  (LICENSES/CC-BY-ND-4.0.txt)
- Unsplash sample images and containers that embed them:
  Unsplash License (LICENSES/LicenseRef-Unsplash.txt)

The software licenses do not grant rights to the OBST name or branding. See
TRADEMARKS.md for the project's name-use policy.
